SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS\, Lake Crabtree Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nCome enjoy nature\, as we do an **ALL 
 LEVELS** vinyasa slow flow to yin yoga practice\, at this beautiful locati
 on\, facing the lake. Modifications provided. Beginners welcome.\n\nBRING 
 YOUR OWN YOGA MAT\, towel\, water bottle\, and block (if you use one)\, su
 nscreen\, insect repellent. You may also want to bring an old towel or lin
 er for under your mat\, if the ground is wet. We will meet in the open fie
 ld area near the parking lot. $15/person Accepting Venmo @Darlene-Genander
  or PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com or cash\n\nLake Crabtree County Park
 \, past the entrance booth\, at the open field\, near volleyball courts an
 d Old Beech Nature Trail... first right after you enter the park.(If you g
 et to the entrance where there are boat rentals and launch area you've gon
 e too far).\nLake Crabtree County Park\, 1400 Aviation Parkway\, Morrisvil
 le
