SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™ FALL YOGA EVENT at For Garden's Sake
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**Another fun Fall Yoga In Nature™\,
  NC event!!!** \\*\\*We will be joining For Garden's Sake (garden center) 
 for another seasonal yoga event and **FALL THEME** **“Harvesting\, trans
 itioning and making room for new growth.”** **$25/person paid in advance
 \, at sign up\, to secure your spot.** \\*\\*\\*Pay by Venmo @Darlene-Gena
 nder (0862 if asked for 4 digits) or by PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com 
 Also accepting Zelle.\n\n\\*\\*BACK AGAIN BY POPULAR DEMAND...\\*\\*ALL TH
 INGS FALL!!! Come join us for a 60 minute vinyasa flow to yin practice for
  ALL LEVELS (as well as first timers). We will gather as a community in a 
 yoga practice that will focus on flowing with our breath as we move our bo
 dies and connect with nature. (No experience necessary\, just an open mind
 :) Theme of this Fall event: *“Harvesting\, transitioning and making roo
 m for new growth.”* Stay for hot seasonal tea. Receive a small seasonal 
 gift!!!\n\nBring a friend! Gift someone special who loves yoga and/or plan
 ts. NOTE THAT FOR GARDEN SAKE WILL BE DECORATED WITH FALL DECOR\, for insp
 iration. Wander the grounds of the garden center's indoor and outdoor plan
 ts\, shrubs and trees. Also\, take a look at their potting shed and visit 
 with the goats and ducks on the property.\n\nBring your own yoga mat and/o
 r towel\, water bottle\, and whatever you may need for your practice.
