SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS\, HALLOWEEN YOGA FLOW\, Lake Crabtr
 ee Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nLET'S CELEBRATE HALLOWEEN WITH A HALLO
 WEEN PLAYLIST AND SOME HALLOWEEN INSPIRED ASANAS. MAY EVEN TRY 'FLOATING G
 HOST'. FEEL FREE TO WEAR A COSTUME THAT YOU CAN MOVE IN OR A BIT OF BLACK\
 , ORANGE AND WHITE:) ALL Levels Vinyasa Flow Yoga\; $15/person\n**ARRIVE E
 ARLY IN ORDER TO GET PARKING.**\n\nCome enjoy nature\, as we do an ALL LEV
 ELS vinyasa flow yoga practice\, at this beautiful location. We will begin
  in a seated meditation\, flow\, then end in savasana. Modifications provi
 ded. Beginners welcome.\n\nBRING YOUR OWN YOGA MAT\, towel\, water bottle\
 , plastic liner (if grass is wet). We will meet in the open field area nea
 r the parking lot. Accepting Venmo @Darlene-Genander or PayPal dgenander@y
 ogainnature.com\n\nLake Crabtree County Park\, past the entrance booth\, a
 t the open field\, near volleyball courts and Old Beech Nature Trail... fi
 rst right after you enter the park.(If you get to the entrance where there
  are boat rentals and launch area you've gone too far).\nLake Crabtree Cou
 nty Park\, 1400 Aviation Parkway\, Morrisville
