SUMMARY:"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness (Fall) Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nWe will come together again for anothe
 r **"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness (Fall) Retreat with the theme '*The A
 rt of Letting Go'*.** This is beginner friendly (including first time stud
 ents). As we immerse ourselves in the fall season\, we learn from nature t
 hat it is okay to let go in order to get ready for the next season (in lif
 e). This day\, set with intention\, will offer you the opportunity to rele
 ase what no longer serves you.\n\n* Vinyasa flow yoga to yin practice (out
 doors\, weather permitting with option for indoor practice)\n* Breathing a
 nd releasing\n* Nature connection and immersion using all of our senses\n*
  Creative time\n* Use of fire pit for releasing ceremony\n* Hot teas and s
 nacks\n* Nourishing lunch\n* Gift bag for your healing journey\n\nSettle i
 n. Open up your heart and let the day feed your soul.\nBring your yoga mat
  and wear layers. We will move from the indoors/outdoors throughout the da
 y. Arrival at 9:45am and programming will be from 10am - 2pm with option t
 o stay and settle in a bit longer (until 3pm) on the porch\, around the po
 nd or inside the cabin in the cozy space.\n**Your payment of $130 is due w
 hen you sign up and holds your spot/ is your ticket to the event.** Please
  pay by Venmo\n@Darlene-Genander (0862 if asked)\, by PayPal dgenander@yog
 ainnature or accepting Zelle
